-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov 23 22:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Textadept 13.1: Qt 6 (textadept), GTK 3
  (textadept-gtk) and curses (textadept-curses) front ends with a
  shared noarch textadept-data package
- Bundled dependencies are the exact archives pinned in upstream's
  CMakeLists.txt; HTML manual taken from the binary release
- Build against the wide-character ncurses headers (ncursesw)
- textadept-install-destdir.patch: install the .desktop files under
  DESTDIR instead of symlinking them into the live /usr/share
- textadept-modules: official modules.zip with its prebuilt binaries
  replaced by file_diff, spellcheck (system hunspell, myspell
  dictionaries) and LuaSocket modules built from source;
  update_notifier left out; shebangs stripped from LSP Lua files
